{
  "zh-hans": {
    "description": {
      "league_ornn": {
        "attack": "【扩展包】<#ff9028ff>活体锻炉<>：装备属性+20%，9级起+35%、友方英雄+10%。W/E/R使敌方英雄<#ff9028ff>易碎<>，普攻打中易碎的英雄造成<#ffffffff>8%最大生命<>真实伤害并<#ef5350ff>击飞<>。<#ff9028ff>风箱炎息<>：每<#ffb900ff>12秒<>喷火，<#ef5350ff>不可阻挡<>并获得护盾，造成<#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<>魔法伤害。",
        "skill": "【扩展包】砸地裂出一道裂隙，造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>物理伤害并<#ef5350ff>减速40%<>，尽头升起挡路的熔岩柱，持续<#ffb900ff>4秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【扩展包】冲向目标，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<>物理伤害。撞上熔岩柱或墙时周围敌人<#ef5350ff>击飞<#ffb900ff>1秒<><>并受到<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<>物理伤害，英雄易碎。"
      }
    }
  },
  "zh-hant": {
    "description": {
      "league_ornn": {
        "attack": "【擴充包】<#ff9028ff>活火爐<>：裝備屬性+20%，9級起+35%、友方英雄+10%。W/E/R使敵方英雄<#ff9028ff>焦化<>，普攻打中焦化的英雄造成<#ffffffff>8%最大生命<>真實傷害並<#ef5350ff>擊飛<>。<#ff9028ff>熾焰吹息<>：每<#ffb900ff>12秒<>噴火，<#ef5350ff>不可阻擋<>並獲得護盾，造成<#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<>魔法傷害。",
        "skill": "【擴充包】砸地裂出一道裂隙，造成<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>物理傷害並<#ef5350ff>緩速40%<>，盡頭升起擋路的熔岩柱，持續<#ffb900ff>4秒<>。",
        "skill2": "【擴充包】衝向目標，造成<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<>物理傷害。撞上熔岩柱或牆時周圍敵人<#ef5350ff>擊飛<#ffb900ff>1秒<><>並受到<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<>物理傷害，英雄焦化。"
      }
    }
  },
  "en": {
    "description": {
      "league_ornn": {
        "attack": "[Add-on] <#ff9028ff>Living Forge<>: item stats +20% (from level 9: +35%, allies +10%). W, E and R make enemy champions <#ff9028ff>Brittle<>; his attack on a Brittle champion deals <#ffffffff>8% of its max health<> as true damage and <#ef5350ff>knocks it up<>. <#ff9028ff>Bellows Breath<>: every <#ffb900ff>12s<> he breathes fire, <#ef5350ff>unstoppable<> and shielded, dealing <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<> magic damage.",
        "skill": "[Add-on] Slams the ground: a fissure deals <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> physical damage and <#ef5350ff>slows 40%<>; a magma pillar that blocks the way rises at its end for <#ffb900ff>4s<>.",
        "skill2": "[Add-on] Charges the target, dealing <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<> physical damage. Slamming into a pillar or a wall: enemies around are <#ef5350ff>knocked up<> for <#ffb900ff>1s<> and take <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<> physical damage, champions made Brittle."
      }
    }
  },
  "ko": {
    "description": {
      "league_ornn": {
        "attack": "[확장] <#ff9028ff>간이 대장간<>: 아이템 능력치 +20%(9레벨부터 +35%, 아군 +10%). W/E/R이 적 챔피언을 <#ff9028ff>불안정<> 상태로 만들고, 불안정한 챔피언을 기본 공격하면 <#ffffffff>최대 체력 8%<> 고정 피해와 <#ef5350ff>에어본<>. <#ff9028ff>불꽃 풀무질<>: <#ffb900ff>12초<>마다 불을 뿜어 <#ef5350ff>저지 불가<>·보호막, <#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<> 마법 피해.",
        "skill": "[확장] 땅을 내리쳐 균열이 <#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<> 물리 피해와 <#ef5350ff>40% 둔화<>. 끝에 길을 막는 용암 기둥이 <#ffb900ff>4초<> 솟음.",
        "skill2": "[확장] 대상에게 돌진해 <#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<> 물리 피해. 기둥이나 벽에 부딪히면 주변 적을 <#ef5350ff>1초 에어본<>시키며 <#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<> 물리 피해, 챔피언은 불안정."
      }
    }
  },
  "ja": {
    "description": {
      "league_ornn": {
        "attack": "【拡張】<#ff9028ff>歩く鍛冶場<>：装備の能力値+20%（9レベルから+35%、味方+10%）。W/E/Rで敵チャンピオンを<#ff9028ff>脆弱<>にし、脆弱な相手への通常攻撃は<#ffffffff>最大体力の8%<>の確定ダメージと<#ef5350ff>ノックアップ<>。<#ff9028ff>ふいごの息<>：<#ffb900ff>12秒<>ごとに炎を吐き、<#ef5350ff>阻害無効<>とシールド、<#a974ffff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#a974ffff>5%<>の魔法ダメージ。",
        "skill": "【拡張】地面を叩き、亀裂が<#ff9028ff>50<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:ad_0><#ff9028ff>100%<>の物理ダメージと<#ef5350ff>40%スロウ<>。終点に道を塞ぐ溶岩の柱が<#ffb900ff>4秒<>立つ。",
        "skill2": "【拡張】対象へ突進し<#ff9028ff>60<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>4%<>の物理ダメージ。柱か壁に当たると周囲の敵を<#ef5350ff>1秒ノックアップ<>して<#ff9028ff>40<> + <i#asset/base/ui/banpick/champion_stat_icon:hp_0><#ff9028ff>3%<>の物理ダメージ、チャンピオンは脆弱。"
      }
    }
  }
}
